WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:01.680
What we need to speak about

00:00:02.680 --> 00:00:08.879
is how to ensure the place and role Europe deserves

00:00:09.519 --> 00:00:12.759
in the construction of this new world.

00:00:13.000 --> 00:00:18.039
This Europe will be more confident

00:00:18.200 --> 00:00:23.600
and more attentive to other populations.

00:00:28.519 --> 00:00:31.239
Since the origins of the European Community,

00:00:32.119 --> 00:00:37.200
I - like many of you - have defended the idea

00:00:37.280 --> 00:00:40.239
of building a social Europe.

00:00:41.039 --> 00:00:47.639
Today, we have traced the outlines of a social Europe

00:00:48.400 --> 00:00:50.519
but there is no content.

00:00:50.600 --> 00:00:53.560
Wouldn't it be an exhilarating,

00:00:54.000 --> 00:00:56.079
fascinating task to create this content?

00:01:00.159 --> 00:01:02.600
A Europe of cultures, ladies and gentlemen,

00:01:02.759 --> 00:01:06.759
is a Europe of nations against nationalism.

00:01:08.839 --> 00:01:12.800
As chance would have it,

00:01:13.200 --> 00:01:17.200
I was born during the First World War

00:01:17.720 --> 00:01:20.639
and fought in the second.

00:01:21.879 --> 00:01:29.159
I lived my childhood against a backdrop of broken families,

00:01:29.800 --> 00:01:35.959
mourning their dead and harbouring bitterness,

00:01:36.039 --> 00:01:39.159
sometimes hatred, towards their recent enemies.

00:01:43.479 --> 00:01:47.239
We need to pass on, not this hatred,

00:01:47.720 --> 00:01:53.079
but on the contrary the chance of a reconciliation 

00:01:53.159 --> 00:01:58.800
that we owe to those of 1944 – 1945

00:01:58.839 --> 00:02:03.800
who had the audacity to envisage a brighter future,

00:02:03.959 --> 00:02:07.239
based on reconciliation and peace.

00:02:07.319 --> 00:02:08.680
That's what we've done.

00:02:10.560 --> 00:02:13.959
Nationalism is war!

00:02:18.800 --> 00:02:26.319
War is not just in the past, it could also be in our future.

00:02:26.959 --> 00:02:30.280
It's us, you, ladies and gentlemen members of Parliament,

00:02:30.479 --> 00:02:33.839
who are the guardians of peace. 

